  "description": "Welcome to Dog Haus! An independent webcomic that follows the daily life of a dog girl named Maggie. Through the use of the nostalgic four-panel-newspaper-style strips, Dog Haus focuses on the raw ups and downs of early adulthood in todays western society, exploring relatable experiences and emotions that come with navigating this stage of life. Join Maggie and her friends as she faces new challenges, meets interesting characters, and discovers more about herself along the way.\n\n(Source: Webtoon)",
